<title>USA: Ross Stores names Call CFO.</title>
<headline>Ross Stores names Call CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Stores Inc, operator of a national chain of discount apparel stores, Monday named John Call as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Call replaces Earl Benson, who left Ross in 1996 to take a position with another company, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>In a statement, Ross said Call, 39, recently served as chief financial officer of Friedmans, a 359-store specialty retailer of jewelry based in Savannah, Ga.</p>
